      "sourceTextSha256": "ac9b25a7a898f680729b33cb5f4460850e803ebe61bc3f7c09ff3fb2c393dde4",
      "text": "Breakfast. Full-day off-road 4x4 safari to the lakes, with lunch included. Along trails and across streams, reach the shore of Lake Fagnano, travel off-road through remote landscapes, then trek through the forest to Lake Escondido and its mountain refuge, observing beaver dams along the shore. Enjoy an Argentine barbecue with Malbec wine before returning to the hotel.",
